===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈɡæ.məˌlæn/}}
* {{audio|en|en-uk-gamelan.ogg|a=UK}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}} (''[[Jawi]] spelling'' ݢميلن)

# {{lb|en|music genre}} A [[genre]] of [[music]] of [[Indonesian]] origin typically featuring [[metallophone]]s, [[xylophone]]s, [[drum]]s, [[gong]]s and a [[bamboo]] [[flute]] (called a [[suling]]).
# An [[ensemble]] performing this style of music.

